OL,3,ATrump says more US attacks on Iran
OL,4,A'highly unlikely'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing reporters in the White House
OL,7,Fpress briefing room, Trump said that
OL,8,Frenewed US attacks on Iran were "highly
OL,9,Funlikely" but that the US was "locked
OL,10,Fand loaded" should the circumstances
OL,11,Fchange.
